{"lyrics":"[Intro: Chief Keef & Juice WRLD]\n[00:04.68] Then she got dressed all up like it was her big day (You know me)\n[00:06.60] Ten toes\n[00:06.86] Then she got dressed all up like it was her big day (You know me)\n[00:11.72] Blowin' on Endo (Endo)\n[00:12.16] Let off the 4-0 (Ayy), turn up, beast mode\n[00:13.14] Can't see me on a Wednesday (I like freak ho's)\n[00:15.10] Then she got dressed all up like it was her big day (Now I'm walking out like D. Rose)\n[Chorus: Chief Keef]\n[00:21.10] You know me (You know me, you know)\n[00:22.96] You know me, I ain't worried about what a hater say (Give a fuck about what a hater say)\n[00:28.52] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Don't care about what a hater say, ayy)\n[00:31.24] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Don't care about what no hater say, nah-nah-nah)\n[00:34.34] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Don't care about what no hater say, nah-nah-nah)\n[00:37.76] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Don't care about what no hater say, nah-nah-nah, ayy)\n[00:47.14] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Don't care about what no hater say, nah-nah-nah, ayy)\n[00:52.92] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Don't care about what no hater say, nah-nah-nah, ayy)\n[Verse 1: Chief Keef]\n[00:56.36] Ayy, but you so bad (You so bad)\n[00:57.88] You get coal (You get coal), for Christmas (For Christmas)\n[01:01.12] And I'm so high (So high), but then I'm cold (Then I'm cold)\n[01:04.72] Lil' stick stickin' out like an afro (Like an afro)\n[01:08.54] Call the cops, I'm dressed to kill (Dressed to kill)\n[01:12.00] \"Do you miss me?\" Just a little, baby, I don't know (Just a little, I don't know)\n[01:16.28] Before using me, you smell my odor, oh, yeah\n[01:19.90] If you cross me, I'ma run you over, yeah\n[01:23.08] Juice, pour that juice up, ayy\n[01:24.92] I'm a king with Medusa, ayy\n[01:26.48] I might spazz, whoosah, ayy\n[01:28.30] Pop you and your group ho', ayy\n[01:29.98] Layin' down in LooLa,