ll the hoes in a pair of Jabos\n[02:56.96] Now it's Margiela my denim, yeah\n[Bridge: Juice WRLD & Chief Keef]\n[03:00.36] Yeah, yeah, yeah\n[03:05.34] Yeah, oh, I'm walkin' on my own\n[03:07.96] It's just me and my gun, make a fuck nigga hit them folks(Oh)\n[Refrain: Juice WRLD & Chief Keef]\n[03:54.20] Yeah (Ooh)\n[03:54.60] Oh, yeah (Oh)\n[03:56.66] Yeah (Ooh, yeah, oh)\n[03:57.20] Oh, yeah (Oh, yeah)\n[Chorus: Chief Keef]\n[04:02.54] You know me (Ayy, ayy, ayy)\n[04:03.40] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, ayy, ayy)\n[04:05.98] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, ayy, ayy)\n[04:13.56] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Say, nah-nah-nah)\n[04:31.56] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Oh, nah-nah-nah)\n[04:35.42] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, ayy, nah-nah)\n[04:39.52] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Nah, nah)\n[04:43.78] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, nah, nah, nah)\n[04:48.88] You know me (You know me)\n[04:51.08] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ah, ah, ah)\n[04:54.92] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, no)\n[04:58.58] I ain't worried about what a hater say (No, nah-nah)\n[05:01.78] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Uh, nah-nah)\n[05:05.22] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, ayy, nah-nah, ayy)\n[05:08.84] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Nah, nah)\n[05:11.42] I ain't worried about what a hater say (Ayy, nah, nah)","words":[[3.96,4.04,"[Intro:"],[4.12,4.2,"Chief"],[4.26,4.34,"Keef"],[4.36,4.38,"&"],[4.42,4.52,"Juice"],[4.56,4.64,"WRLD]"],[4.68,4.74,"Then"],[4.78,4.82,"she"],[4.86,4.96,"got"],[5.0,5.14,"dressed"],[5.18,5.24,"all"],[5.28,5.3,"up"],[5.34,5.56,"like"],[5.6,5.62,"it"],[5.66,5.74,"was"],[5.78,5.9,"her"],[5.96,6.08,"big"],[6.14,6.18,"day"],[6.22,6.26,"(You"],[6.3,6.5,"know"],[6.54,6.56,"me)"],[6.6,6.72,"Ten"],[6.76,6.82,"toes"],[6.86,6.94,"Then"],[7.04,7.08,"she"],[7.16,7.2,"got"],[7.24,8.06,"dressed"],[9.44,10.66,"all"],[10.8,10.82,"up"],[10.86,10